      en: ["A central logistics hub in close proximity to the deep-water port.", "Specializes in the distribution of agricultural and industrial goods.", "The primary service provider for long-haul freight transport in the south.", "Offers extensive capacity for freight storage.", "A center for fleet management and vehicle logistics."]
